\sigma\sqrt{1+\frac{\sigma^2}{\mu-1}}\}}(k-2)-
F_{\{\mu-1+\frac{\sigma^2}{\mu-1},
\sigma\sqrt{1+\frac{\sigma^2}{\mu-1}}\}}(k))}

where \eqn{F_{\{\mu,\sigma\}}} is the cumulative density function of a Gamma
